&lt;div class="markdown-heading"&gt;
&lt;h2 class="heading-element"&gt;Why&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When you pass a product problem between research, design and coding assistants, things go missing in the handoffs:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;the source of a requirement gets lost;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an open question quietly becomes an accepted fact;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;"the tests pass" turns out to refer to yesterday's code;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;an agent's "done" is taken at its word.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

